      },
      "text": ", Saturday: Canaima National Park"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:b9ad3e14216c2f08",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "bba8c68818a8a6be417afbf20dce286b5f778cfe05324ff931fa427510d13672",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261110-o0ph8fryncjmw9u91va",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Relax by Canaima Lagoon. Optional activities include a helicopter or light aircraft flight over Angel Falls, an outing to Kavak Canyon with a flight over the falls, a hike on Kuravaina Tepui, a trip to the Blue Lagoon or Sakaika Lagoon, kayaking and cycling.\n\nMeals: breakfast, lunch and dinner."
    },
    {
